            "q": "How can I find a verified beauty parlour in Pirojpur on Parloora?",
            "a": "Visit the Pirojpur district page on Parloora to browse verified beauty parlours, hair salons, and makeup artists. You can filter by service type, compare real prices, read authentic client reviews, and book online with instant confirmation."
