    section9_cta: "Ready to refresh your style or prepare for an upcoming celebration in Pirojpur? Explore verified beauty parlours, hair salons, and bridal makeup artists across Pirojpur on Parloora today. Compare authentic prices, review genuine client feedback, and book your appointment in seconds. If you own a beauty business or salon in Pirojpur, register with Parloora today to welcome new clients to your salon.",
